  "steps": [
    "Beat 2 eggs in a bowl.",
    "Heat cooking oil in a pan, add sliced green onion, and stir-fry.",
    "Add 100g of drained tuna and stir-fry together with the green onion.",
    "Push the tuna and green onion to one side, pour the beaten eggs into the empty side, scramble, and mix everything together.",
    "Add 2 tablespoons of soy sauce and stir-fry well.",
    "Add 1 full bowl of rice and stir-fry until thoroughly combined.",
    "Add sesame oil and mix into the fried rice.",
    "Pack the fried rice into a bowl, invert it onto a serving dish, and sprinkle sesame seeds on top.",
    "Optionally serve with sriracha sauce."
